cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the manuscript."
title: "TMNet: Time-Series Multi-domain Net for response prediction and prognostic stratification in esophageal squamous cell carcinoma"
abstract: >-
  Code accompanying a multicentre study on longitudinal CT radiomics and deep learning for
  predicting pathological complete response and stratifying prognosis in esophageal squamous
  cell carcinoma after neoadjuvant immunochemotherapy.
type: software
